Smooth Shell Corners
Maintained by sssxks: https://github.com/sssxks/smooth-shell-corners

Forked from Rounded Windows:
https://github.com/Nathanaelrc/rounded-windows

Includes code adapted from:
- yilozt, rounded-window-corners: squircle shader and window-effect architecture
  https://github.com/yilozt/rounded-window-corners
- flexagoon, Rounded Window Corners Reborn: GJS adaptations and shadow handling
  https://github.com/flexagoon/rounded-window-corners

GNOME Shell and Mutter provided the platform and implementation references:
https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-shell
https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/mutter
